                "P_v = \\frac{1}{2} \\rho V^2 = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 1.171\\text{ kg/m}^3 \\times (4.3364\\text{ m/s})^2 = 0.5 \\times 1.171 \\times 18.8044 = \\mathbf{11.0100\\text{ Pa}} \\tag{21.17}",
